---
source: tests/show.rs
expression: "show(\"managed\")"
---
Claude Code configuration for <tmp>/project

Sources
  user                           ~/.claude/settings.json
  managed:managed-settings.json  <tmp>/managed/managed-settings.json
  managed:10-team.json           <tmp>/managed/managed-settings.d/10-team.json
  state                          ~/.claude.json
  managed mcp                    <tmp>/managed/managed-mcp.json

Workspace trust: accepted

Permissions
  mode: default (not set)
  deny
    WebFetch      managed:managed-settings.json
    Bash(curl *)  managed:10-team.json
  ask: none
  allow
    WebFetch(domain:example.com)  user
  additionalDirectories: none

Hooks
  Stop
    *  command: notify-send done  user  (ignored: managed policy allows managed hooks only)

MCP servers
  corp  managed  http: https://mcp.corp.example/mcp
  mine  user     stdio: my-server  (blocked: managed-mcp.json is exclusive)

Settings that run commands
  none

Environment (values hidden)
  ORDER  managed:10-team.json  (overrides managed:managed-settings.json)

Sandbox
  not configured (off by default)

Plugins (hooks and MCP servers from plugins are not read yet)
  none
